libfwsi
------------------------------------------
libfwsi is a library to access the Windows Shell Item format.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libcdata1-20260703-1bl1
  libcerror1-20260703-1bl1
  libclocale1-20260703-1bl1
  libcnotify1-20260703-1bl1
  libfguid1-20260521-1bl1
  libfwsi-devel-20260522-1bl1
  libfwsi1-20260522-1bl1
  libuna1-20260602-1bl2
  pkg-config-3.0.10-1
  python312-3.12.12-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  autoconf-20260320-3
  automake-20260320-2
  binutils-2.47-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  gettext-devel-0.22.5-1
  libcdata-devel-20260703-1bl1
  libcerror-devel-20260703-1bl1
  libclocale-devel-20260703-1bl1
  libcnotify-devel-20260703-1bl1
  libcthreads-devel-20260703-1bl1
  libfdatetime-devel-20260521-1bl1
  libfguid-devel-20260521-1bl1
  libfole-devel-20260521-1bl1
  libfwps-devel-20260522-1bl1
  libtool-2.6.2-1
  libuna-devel-20260602-1bl2
  make-4.4.1-2
  python3-3.12.12-1
  python3-devel-3.12.12-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/libyal/libfwsi

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/libyal/libfwsi/archive/refs/tags/20260522.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack libfwsi-20260522-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./libfwsi-20260522-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/libfwsi-20260522-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libfwsi-20260522-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libfwsi1-20260522-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libfwsi-devel-20260522-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/python312-libfwsi-20260522-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(libfwsi)
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/libfwsi.README
  /usr/share/doc/libfwsi/AUTHORS
  /usr/share/doc/libfwsi/COPYING
  /usr/share/doc/libfwsi/COPYING.LESSER
  /usr/share/doc/libfwsi/ChangeLog
  /usr/share/doc/libfwsi/README

(libfwsi1)
  /usr/bin/cygfwsi-1.dll

(libfwsi-devel)
  /usr/include/libfwsi.h
  /usr/include/libfwsi/codepage.h
  /usr/include/libfwsi/definitions.h
  /usr/include/libfwsi/error.h
  /usr/include/libfwsi/extern.h
  /usr/include/libfwsi/features.h
  /usr/include/libfwsi/types.h
  /usr/lib/libfwsi.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/libfwsi.pc
  /usr/share/man/man3/libfwsi.3.gz

(python312-libfwsi)
  /usr/lib/python3.12/site-packages/pyfwsi.dll

